WEBVTT

00:06.548 --> 00:09.300
[sweet airy music]

00:43.835 --> 00:45.420
Well, I'm sure it's obvious.

00:46.004 --> 00:47.881
He's the one who liked me first.

00:48.923 --> 00:50.008
[scoffs]

00:50.091 --> 00:51.384
That's what she said?

00:51.468 --> 00:52.427
[chuckles]

00:52.510 --> 00:53.636
Is she sick or something?

00:53.720 --> 00:58.057
Well, Ung still followed me around
after the documentary had ended.

00:58.141 --> 01:01.269
So here's what I believe,
he asked me out first.

01:01.352 --> 01:02.187
[clicks tongue]

01:02.854 --> 01:05.190
God, I should've snapped out of it
and ran away

01:05.273 --> 01:06.941
when she threw herself at me.

01:08.485 --> 01:10.653
- Hmm. I'm not sure.
- [water pours]

01:10.737 --> 01:12.739
It's so vague, so I can't really tell.

01:12.822 --> 01:15.950
It's not a special memory
worth remembering.

01:16.034 --> 01:18.078
[Ung scoffs in disbelief]
She doesn't remember?

01:18.161 --> 01:19.829
Wow, unbelievable.

01:20.455 --> 01:22.415
I remember it clearly, you know.

01:22.499 --> 01:25.835
It was that fated day
when everything had gone south.

01:27.462 --> 01:28.338
[rain pattering]

01:28.421 --> 01:29.506
[Ung yelping]

01:30.757 --> 01:33.301
[Ung] It was the final day
of the documentary shooting.

01:34.010 --> 01:35.637
[Dong-il] Oh, it's raining cats and dogs.

01:35.720 --> 01:37.806
How come it wasn't announced
in the forecast?

01:37.889 --> 01:39.098
So how's your camera?

01:39.182 --> 01:40.308
[Dong-il] It's working fine.

01:41.059 --> 01:44.145
Problem is, the battery's dead.

01:44.229 --> 01:45.188
What?

01:45.271 --> 01:48.066
[Dong-il] Too bad, this is the best place
to end our shooting.

01:49.692 --> 01:52.320
By the looks of it,
I'm sure it's just a passing shower.

01:52.987 --> 01:55.573
Stay here, guys.
I'll go get batteries and umbrellas.

01:55.657 --> 01:56.950
Don't go anywhere, please.

01:57.033 --> 01:58.701
We must have
our final interview here today.

01:58.785 --> 02:00.328
You want us to wait here alone?

02:00.411 --> 02:01.538
Yes, I won't take long.

02:01.621 --> 02:03.665
Wait, let me go with…

02:03.748 --> 02:05.083
[rain pattering]

02:12.298 --> 02:14.384
[rain pattering]

02:17.303 --> 02:18.638
[Ung] How should I put it?

02:19.764 --> 02:23.351
Everything felt really awkward that day.

02:25.854 --> 02:27.105
It was just very awkward.

02:27.730 --> 02:30.567
[sighs]
It was sunny until just a while ago.

02:30.650 --> 02:32.360
[sighs]
I know.

02:33.153 --> 02:34.988
- [rain pattering]
- [shivers]

02:42.620 --> 02:45.456
[Ung] Suddenly, I was worried about her.

02:46.332 --> 02:48.376
[sweet light music]

03:04.434 --> 03:05.560
Why?

03:06.102 --> 03:07.896
[rain pattering]

03:12.191 --> 03:13.318
Thank you.

03:17.614 --> 03:20.074
Everything felt a little bit different.

03:20.158 --> 03:21.492
Aren't you cold?

03:22.076 --> 03:24.495
[clears throat]
No. Not at all.

03:25.330 --> 03:26.331
[chuckles softly]

03:29.834 --> 03:32.211
[Ung] Maybe it was
because it was our last shooting day.

03:40.136 --> 03:42.263
[soft gentle music]

03:50.063 --> 03:50.980
And it turned out…

03:51.898 --> 03:54.067
I wasn't the only one who felt that way.

03:56.319 --> 03:57.820
She also…

04:01.574 --> 04:02.992
[Yeon-su] Don't make me laugh.

04:03.076 --> 04:04.369
[chuckles]

04:04.452 --> 04:05.703
Is that what he said?

04:06.704 --> 04:09.540
[sighs]
Looks like he fabricated his memory again.

04:10.041 --> 04:11.834
[rain pattering]

04:13.503 --> 04:15.672
[Yeon-su] It wasn't
that kind of mood that rainy day.

04:16.172 --> 04:17.298
What is it?

04:22.387 --> 04:24.931
It was like just an ordinary day.

04:26.307 --> 04:28.309
Would you stop distracting me
and just sit here?

04:29.602 --> 04:31.104
[rain pattering]

04:34.941 --> 04:38.361
Oh, look.
It was sunny until just a while ago.

04:38.987 --> 04:40.363
Atmospheric instability.

04:40.989 --> 04:42.824
The upper layers contain cool air.

04:42.907 --> 04:45.076
The sudden increase in temperature
during the day

04:45.159 --> 04:46.995
has made the atmosphere unstable.

04:47.078 --> 04:49.038
The strong updraft
creates rain clouds that--

04:49.122 --> 04:51.541
Stop. Do you have to get
all scientific right now?

04:51.624 --> 04:52.667
You're tiring me out.

04:52.750 --> 04:56.462
We studied it in our freshman year,
but I guess you weren't paying attention.

04:57.630 --> 04:59.632
[Yeon-su] Choi Ung was still
dumb as usual.

05:00.550 --> 05:02.885
[cheeky awkward music]

05:09.434 --> 05:11.019
[shivering]

05:11.102 --> 05:12.603
And he was still an idiot.

05:12.687 --> 05:13.563
What are you doing?

05:15.648 --> 05:18.776
Oh, you didn't see?
[chuckles awkwardly]

05:22.113 --> 05:24.240
- You can just keep it on.
- No, take it.

05:24.324 --> 05:26.159
Don't force yourself, okay? Keep it on.

05:26.242 --> 05:27.952
No, I said I'm fine.

05:28.036 --> 05:29.120
[Yeon-su] Gosh.

05:29.203 --> 05:30.872
Just take it, okay? Here.

05:31.372 --> 05:33.333
[awkward music]

05:34.834 --> 05:36.336
[shivering]

05:36.419 --> 05:37.712
- [Ung groans]
- [clears throat]

05:40.673 --> 05:43.843
I guess, the details may have been
slightly different from hers…

05:43.926 --> 05:45.094
[clears throat]

05:45.178 --> 05:48.931
He probably remembers himself
as some really amazing guy back then.

05:49.015 --> 05:51.893
She must remember herself
as being all nonchalant,

05:51.976 --> 05:54.187
but she was the one
who was acting strange that day.

05:54.270 --> 05:57.190
Well, I was acting normally. As usual.

05:57.273 --> 05:59.275
It wasn't like her to do that.
But that day…

05:59.358 --> 06:00.735
That time, he was the one who kept--

06:00.818 --> 06:02.862
I can tell that she was
setting the mood that time.

06:05.740 --> 06:07.742
[soft music]

06:11.079 --> 06:12.497
[Ung] I need to move the cabbages.

06:13.539 --> 06:16.918
Wait, you're not going to mention
how she and I dated, are you?

06:17.001 --> 06:18.461
Not sure yet. That's up to me.

06:18.544 --> 06:20.296
Are you crazy? I won't allow it.

06:21.297 --> 06:23.007
I have the right, since I'm the producer.

06:24.550 --> 06:26.636
Nike, Coca Cola, McDonald's,

06:26.719 --> 06:28.638
Samsung, Volvo, Louis Vuitton, Chanel.

06:28.721 --> 06:31.933
Fucking, jerking, son of a bitch,

06:32.016 --> 06:34.185
shitty, bitchy, dickhead,

06:34.268 --> 06:36.312
motherfucker, jackass.

06:37.814 --> 06:39.607
You can choose not to cut that one,

06:39.690 --> 06:41.484
but you'll have to censor
every single word.

06:42.068 --> 06:43.486
You two are just like twins, you know.

06:43.569 --> 06:45.738
Don't you dare mention
our past relationship

06:45.822 --> 06:47.365
in any part of this. Okay?

06:47.865 --> 06:49.367
Are we done with the interview?

06:51.202 --> 06:54.163
EPISODE 4
THE BOY, OR THE GIRL, WE LIKED THEN

06:54.247 --> 06:56.332
- [woman] Did you have that recorded?
- [man] Yeah. Why?

06:56.415 --> 06:57.625
[Ji-ung sighs]

06:59.168 --> 07:03.005
So, okay.
These are your terms for doing this show?

07:03.089 --> 07:05.842
I'll be straightforward with you
since you know everything.

07:05.925 --> 07:07.969
We're not really doing this
because we want to.

07:08.052 --> 07:10.346
In fact, it'll be very uncomfortable.

07:11.472 --> 07:13.516
Uncomfortable? Maybe to you, but not me.

07:13.599 --> 07:15.601
[Ung] Oh, boy.
I wonder why you feel that way.

07:15.685 --> 07:17.603
[Yeon-su] Really, you're okay with that?

07:17.687 --> 07:20.231
Oh, I'm so relieved to know
that you have no problems with that.

07:20.314 --> 07:22.525
Since you're pretty childish
and act like you're so pathetic,

07:22.608 --> 07:24.944
and I was really worried about you.

07:25.027 --> 07:25.945
[Ung] Who's pathetic?

07:26.654 --> 07:28.489
[scoffs]
That's not true.

07:28.573 --> 07:30.158
Okay, fine, that was a long time ago.

07:30.241 --> 07:32.910
And as you can see,
I've changed a bit. Hmm…

07:33.619 --> 07:37.248
See, I'm successful enough for someone
to visit and beg to work with me.

07:37.331 --> 07:40.251
[Yeon-su] Hey. When did I ever
beg you to work with me?

07:40.334 --> 07:43.588
Well, you crossed the line
when you called me pathetic.

07:43.671 --> 07:44.964
Zip it, you two.

07:45.673 --> 07:48.050
Can I read these terms in peace?

07:48.634 --> 07:51.971
[cheeky tense music]

07:54.307 --> 07:55.766
DO NOT FILM MY PRIVATE LIFE
WITHOUT CONSENT

07:55.850 --> 07:57.977
VIOLATION OF THE TERMS
WILL LEAD TO TERMINATION OF THE SHOOT

08:00.480 --> 08:01.772
TERMS AND CONDITIONS

08:01.856 --> 08:03.941
DO NOT ANNOY ME
DO NOT BOTHER ME

08:04.984 --> 08:05.985
[sighs]

08:06.068 --> 08:09.572
All right. I'll do my best
to comply to your terms.

08:10.990 --> 08:14.160
Oh, first of all, you need to get used
to having cameras around you.

08:14.243 --> 08:15.411
We won't do anything special.

08:15.495 --> 08:17.830
So you can both go on
with your daily lives.

08:17.914 --> 08:21.209
Then we'll proceed to filming
the both of you spending time together.

08:21.292 --> 08:24.504
My everyday routine is going to work
and coming home, and that's all.

08:24.587 --> 08:25.838
Would that be okay?

08:25.922 --> 08:28.049
I doubt my boss
will let you film me at work.

08:28.132 --> 08:30.468
He's already said yes,
so we'll be there to film you.

08:30.551 --> 08:32.845
He seemed happy,
since his project would gain attention.

08:33.429 --> 08:35.598
But I can't work
if there are others around me.

08:35.681 --> 08:37.934
Then we'll just
set up the camera without the crew.

08:38.017 --> 08:41.270
Look, do you honestly think
that this will be entertaining?

08:41.354 --> 08:43.314
I can already see that it'll be boring.

08:43.397 --> 08:46.234
Well, that's up to me to decide,
so don't worry.

08:46.317 --> 08:48.027
[Ji-ung] Do you have any other questions?

08:48.528 --> 08:51.531
But since apparently you both
feel uncomfortable about this,

08:51.614 --> 08:53.282
are you sure you'll be all right?

08:53.366 --> 08:55.201
- Jerk.
- [Ji-ung] Let's give it a shot, okay?

09:02.500 --> 09:05.086
Ji-ung. I'm afraid this will flop.

09:12.009 --> 09:13.010
[sighs]

09:13.803 --> 09:16.722
[upbeat music]

09:18.891 --> 09:19.976
[sighs]

09:20.059 --> 09:22.353
- [Chang-sik] Hey, I'm here already.
- [gasps]

09:25.189 --> 09:26.190
What's this?

09:26.274 --> 09:27.400
[yawns loudly]

09:28.568 --> 09:29.819
Are you filming again?

09:31.821 --> 09:33.489
Are you filming him too?

09:33.573 --> 09:35.616
- Chang-sik, get out of the shot.
- [Ung] Hello, Mr. Jung.

09:35.700 --> 09:40.162
By the way… Oh, hey there.
What's the concept for today?

09:40.246 --> 09:43.165
Don't worry about that, Mr. Jung.
You can just eat and leave after.

09:43.249 --> 09:45.251
Come on, how could I not worry about that?

09:45.334 --> 09:46.460
My goodness.

09:46.544 --> 09:49.088
Chang-sik, you're also here.
Go over there first.

09:49.171 --> 09:51.674
By the way, Ji-ung,
aren't you filming my hardware store?

09:51.757 --> 09:53.009
[Chang-sik] Why not?

09:53.092 --> 09:54.051
[yawns]

09:56.804 --> 09:58.556
You're doing this again with Ung?

09:58.639 --> 09:59.890
Have you gone insane?

10:00.391 --> 10:02.977
[sighs]
Do you think I was really up for this?

10:03.060 --> 10:05.438
Too bad it's always the working class

10:05.521 --> 10:07.398
that has to make ends meet.

10:07.481 --> 10:09.525
But are you okay seeing that guy again?

10:09.609 --> 10:12.612
- Don't tell me that you two--
- I've had enough of your nonsense.

10:13.321 --> 10:14.822
Okay.
[inhales]

10:14.905 --> 10:16.824
What's over is over, you know that.

10:16.907 --> 10:19.410
- Just get a grip, okay?
- Goodness, it's nothing like that.

10:21.329 --> 10:22.955
Oh, how long have you been filming?

10:23.039 --> 10:25.541
Oh. Don't worry about us
and just talk freely.

10:25.625 --> 10:28.628
Um, you won't be able
to air this if we talk freely.

10:29.545 --> 10:32.632
Most office workers would rather
rest or sleep on the weekends,

10:32.715 --> 10:34.383
but I'm not like them, you know.

10:34.467 --> 10:37.261
I don't like wasting my time,
even on rest days.

10:37.345 --> 10:40.264
That's why I do productive activities,
even on weekends.

10:40.348 --> 10:41.641
Like this, you see.

10:41.724 --> 10:43.851
I like jogging in the morning.

10:45.227 --> 10:47.897
- [Yeon-su] I don't like naps.
- It's really obvious she's enjoying this.

10:47.980 --> 10:50.316
You should only sleep at night.
I hate being lazy in the day

10:50.399 --> 10:52.735
and waste time taking naps,
like someone does.

10:52.818 --> 10:55.196
So much for that, I'll slow down today.

10:55.279 --> 10:56.739
- Just follow me.
- Come on.

10:59.283 --> 11:01.827
It's also obvious
that she looked forward to this.

11:03.287 --> 11:05.122
[sighs]
What's this girl trying to do?

11:09.377 --> 11:12.254
[Ung snoring]

11:30.147 --> 11:31.315
[soft chuckle]

11:31.399 --> 11:32.274
STAR START-UP COMPANY

11:32.358 --> 11:33.818
Oh, yes.
[chuckles]

11:36.904 --> 11:38.989
[sweet airy music]

12:03.597 --> 12:05.141
Our new menu. Try it.

12:05.724 --> 12:07.601
[sweet airy music continues]

12:12.815 --> 12:14.775
- Mmm.
- How is it? Is it good?

12:14.859 --> 12:17.945
- Not really.
- Go home. Why are you here?

12:18.028 --> 12:19.738
[Sol-i] Also, get lost.

12:22.741 --> 12:26.662
Hey you, would you stop filming
and help me peel these onions instead.

12:26.745 --> 12:28.330
Come on, just pretend I'm invisible.

12:28.414 --> 12:30.916
[annoyed sigh]
Well, that sucks, producer Kim.

12:31.000 --> 12:34.420
Look, you need to film something fun,
yet here I am, peeling onions.

12:34.503 --> 12:36.088
[chuckles]

12:36.172 --> 12:38.382
Anyway, should I be more entertaining?

12:38.466 --> 12:39.967
[chuckles]

12:40.759 --> 12:41.594
I think he's lost it.

12:41.677 --> 12:42.970
[chuckles]

12:46.932 --> 12:48.934
Hey, what's up?

12:49.018 --> 12:50.895
Why are you so gloomy?

12:52.813 --> 12:54.815
Where are the new staff members?

12:55.524 --> 12:56.609
Oh.

12:58.152 --> 12:59.653
- Goodbye.
- Dong-il.

13:00.237 --> 13:01.780
I'm doing my best, okay.

13:01.864 --> 13:03.240
[Dong-il] But they're already busy.

13:03.324 --> 13:05.868
The ones who are available
don't wanna work with you.

13:05.951 --> 13:07.495
That's not my fault.

13:07.578 --> 13:10.039
How could you not help us
during this critical moment?

13:10.122 --> 13:11.582
You're the one who forced me to do this.

13:11.665 --> 13:13.083
I get it, I do.

13:13.167 --> 13:16.587
I promise I will send you
some reliable crew members.

13:17.963 --> 13:19.340
So hang in there.

13:20.174 --> 13:22.468
Sorry, Chae-ran,
you have to go through this.

13:26.972 --> 13:28.057
[sighs]

13:28.140 --> 13:31.101
- Any footage that we can save?
- No, none at all.

13:34.522 --> 13:35.898
I need you to call them over.

13:38.817 --> 13:39.902
Hmm?

13:41.028 --> 13:42.029
Ji-ung!

13:44.448 --> 13:45.491
Are you here?

13:48.661 --> 13:49.537
He left?

13:55.292 --> 13:56.293
[clears throat]

14:00.464 --> 14:01.799
[satisfied sigh]

14:01.882 --> 14:05.219
[Ung] At last. This filming
could end sooner than expected.

14:05.302 --> 14:06.345
And that's great.

14:09.598 --> 14:10.975
[sighs]

14:11.058 --> 14:13.435
[groans]
Finally, some peace for me.

14:22.069 --> 14:24.238
[soft calm music]

14:42.214 --> 14:45.551
[Ung] I have… trouble sleeping deeply.

14:49.763 --> 14:52.266
I'm always half-awake or half-asleep.

14:59.982 --> 15:04.153
I probably have… 500 dreams every time.

15:06.488 --> 15:08.490
[soft calm music continues]

15:16.582 --> 15:19.001
That's why I often can't tell

15:20.085 --> 15:21.337
a dream from reality.

15:32.097 --> 15:35.476
- [Yeon-su] Hey, you okay?
- [Ung] But this one is definitely a dream.

15:38.145 --> 15:41.023
[soft gentle music]

16:15.683 --> 16:17.017
- Oh!
- [Yeon-su] The hell?

16:18.018 --> 16:20.104
What? You're here.

16:20.729 --> 16:22.106
Yuck. What was that?

16:22.815 --> 16:24.358
You're… you're real.

16:24.441 --> 16:26.902
What are you talking about?
Were you dreaming?

16:26.986 --> 16:28.821
How long have you been here?

16:28.904 --> 16:31.699
It's just that you came over here
unannounced. So I was startled.

16:31.782 --> 16:33.367
I just got here, weirdo.

16:33.951 --> 16:35.202
Ji-ung wanted to talk to us now.

16:36.829 --> 16:39.415
You're sleeping in the middle of the day?

16:39.498 --> 16:40.708
Because I can't sleep well.

16:41.458 --> 16:42.418
Why can't you?

16:51.093 --> 16:52.052
[Ung] Where's Ji-ung?

16:53.429 --> 16:54.930
He just went out for a bit.

16:55.514 --> 16:56.432
Oh.

17:00.477 --> 17:01.562
[sighs]

17:11.655 --> 17:12.906
[groans]

17:18.996 --> 17:23.167
[Ung] I'm… I'm going
to head down to my studio.

17:23.959 --> 17:24.835
Hmm?

17:26.378 --> 17:29.965
If you have nothing to do,
you can check out my drawings.

17:32.885 --> 17:35.304
Although, they're all downstairs.

17:40.059 --> 17:41.810
[footsteps thumping]

17:43.270 --> 17:45.355
[bright music]

17:48.192 --> 17:49.777
[gasps]
Wow.

17:51.987 --> 17:53.405
[Yeon-su clears throat]

17:58.160 --> 18:01.288
[Yeon-su] Oh, I really like that one.

18:02.122 --> 18:03.916
[Ung] Don't study them
too closely, though.

18:04.541 --> 18:06.376
This one. Where's this located?

18:08.128 --> 18:09.630
Oh, this one here?

18:10.422 --> 18:12.633
This is in Paris, France.

18:12.716 --> 18:14.968
He's the one who designed the Soen Shop.

18:15.052 --> 18:16.762
And he's my favorite architect.

18:17.471 --> 18:19.848
I see. That's why you took the offer.

18:19.932 --> 18:21.016
Mm-hmm.

18:28.273 --> 18:29.942
[Yeon-su] This is truly unexpected of you.

18:31.068 --> 18:32.236
What do you mean?

18:32.319 --> 18:36.073
What I mean is, back then, when you were
drawing all the time in class,

18:36.156 --> 18:38.492
I thought you just didn't want to study.

18:38.575 --> 18:40.953
[Ung] Hey, everyone has
their own strong suit, you know.

18:41.870 --> 18:44.915
Yet you were always nagging me
about studying day in, day out.

18:44.998 --> 18:46.959
Do you realize how sadistic you were?

18:47.042 --> 18:49.461
Thanks to my nagging,
you attended university.

18:57.678 --> 18:58.762
What?

19:02.057 --> 19:03.142
Isn't this…

19:09.064 --> 19:10.566
[student chatter]

19:17.030 --> 19:18.448
Oh.

19:19.825 --> 19:22.286
Oh, no. My bad.

19:24.580 --> 19:26.582
Hey, this is nothing serious.

19:26.665 --> 19:28.417
- You can just erase it, okay.
- No…

19:32.462 --> 19:34.756
[sweet airy music]

19:36.425 --> 19:38.427
- Turn off the camera.
- Please don't do it.

19:38.510 --> 19:39.928
[sighs]
Turn it off.

19:40.012 --> 19:42.681
No, I said
don't turn off your camera, please.

19:42.764 --> 19:44.057
[suspenseful clock ticking]

19:45.392 --> 19:47.060
[Ung] Hey, Kook Yeon-su!

19:47.144 --> 19:48.604
Follow them, go on! Damn it.

19:50.814 --> 19:53.066
[sweet airy music]

19:53.150 --> 19:54.193
[music stops]

20:21.094 --> 20:22.930
[creaking]

20:51.416 --> 20:54.378
[light piano music]

21:21.697 --> 21:23.740
- You said you threw it away.
- [scoffs]

21:23.824 --> 21:27.077
I thought I did. Why was this still there?

21:27.160 --> 21:29.579
You even caused a scene
and blamed me for ruining it.

21:29.663 --> 21:32.457
See? If you just glance at it,
you can't even tell.

21:32.541 --> 21:34.418
It's true that you ruined my drawing.

21:34.501 --> 21:35.711
Here. You can see it up close!

21:35.794 --> 21:37.587
Oh, please. It wasn't so bad.

21:37.671 --> 21:40.173
Yet you were so petty,
you sulked for days because of it.

21:40.257 --> 21:41.550
Am I wrong?

21:41.633 --> 21:43.468
There are many things about me
that you ruined.

21:44.344 --> 21:47.014
Hey, I only messed up one drawing…

21:47.097 --> 21:49.349
No, two. That's all.

21:49.433 --> 21:50.892
That's all I can remember.

21:51.727 --> 21:53.729
Well, you also ruined my life.

21:54.479 --> 21:56.189
You wreaked havoc.
[groans]

21:56.815 --> 21:58.275
[Ung] I shouldn't have said that.

21:58.358 --> 21:59.651
[Yeon-su] Hey.

22:01.570 --> 22:03.071
That was really harsh, Ung.

22:07.117 --> 22:08.744
What part of it did I ruin?

22:10.454 --> 22:12.205
[Ung] Why the hell did I say that?

22:12.289 --> 22:15.751
What's this?
Are you not going to explain yourself now?

22:16.752 --> 22:17.627
It's the truth, though.

22:20.297 --> 22:23.175
[Ung] I wonder, why do I get
so upset like this at times?

22:23.967 --> 22:26.053
[Yeon-su] Exactly how long
will you keep this up?

22:26.136 --> 22:29.264
How badly did I ruin your life
for you to act like that?

22:29.348 --> 22:31.058
Look around you. You're doing very well.

22:31.141 --> 22:32.434
So where's the havoc?

22:32.517 --> 22:35.103
Maybe it's hard to tell at a glance
like my drawing.

22:37.230 --> 22:38.648
[sighs]

22:40.192 --> 22:43.028
How long will you treat me
like I'm a scum of the earth?

22:43.904 --> 22:47.866
We've agreed to do this documentary,
so can't we please just get along?

22:48.867 --> 22:50.202
[Ung] That was also my intention.

22:51.119 --> 22:53.955
I'm sorry, I can't be like you.

22:55.082 --> 22:57.876
So why am I being
so pathetic at this moment?

22:58.710 --> 23:00.712
["Maybe If" by BIBI playing]

23:07.427 --> 23:10.430
You think you're the victim here
because I kept quiet.

23:10.514 --> 23:11.681
You're ridiculous.

23:11.765 --> 23:13.600
Then speak your mind even for once.

23:15.060 --> 23:17.938
Do you think our breakup
was entirely my fault?

23:19.940 --> 23:22.692
["Maybe If" by BIBI continues]

23:36.623 --> 23:38.041
Stop filming, Ji-ung.

23:39.417 --> 23:40.794
[soft chuckle]
You caught me.

23:40.877 --> 23:43.088
Can we at least have some privacy?

23:44.131 --> 23:46.842
Well, it is my duty to film you.

23:46.925 --> 23:49.302
Why did you show up just now?
Let's go up and talk.

23:52.264 --> 23:53.348
[Ji-ung] Let's go.

23:56.434 --> 23:58.353
[footsteps thumping]

24:05.026 --> 24:07.195
[Chae-ran] The atmosphere
feels tense right now.

24:10.240 --> 24:11.449
Or is it just me?

24:16.872 --> 24:19.624
I'm sorry,
but I have other plans for today.

24:19.708 --> 24:20.959
I should go. Just call me.

24:21.585 --> 24:22.669
[sighs]

24:29.301 --> 24:30.635
Okay, so how about you…

24:30.719 --> 24:31.553
[sighs]

24:31.636 --> 24:33.889
I'm having second thoughts
about this documentary.

24:40.020 --> 24:40.854
[Chae-ran sighs]

24:40.937 --> 24:42.230
[Chae-ran] It's a total mess.

24:42.314 --> 24:44.232
We couldn't even talk about the concept.

24:44.316 --> 24:45.692
Well, we saw this one coming, though.

24:47.360 --> 24:50.530
So, okay. Should we just continue
following them around?

24:52.199 --> 24:53.200
Let's just call it a day.

24:53.283 --> 24:55.619
Are you going home? I can drop you off.

24:55.702 --> 24:59.331
[engine rumbling]

25:01.458 --> 25:03.710
I think we should start
with their reviews.

25:03.793 --> 25:04.961
What?

25:05.045 --> 25:06.630
On how they felt when they'd first met,

25:06.713 --> 25:09.341
on why they both agreed
to film it a decade ago,

25:10.258 --> 25:12.344
and how they feel after being reunited.

25:12.928 --> 25:15.263
Let's make them reminisce
about the good memories they had.

25:16.014 --> 25:16.848
Mm.

25:17.349 --> 25:19.142
They dated before, didn't they?

25:19.976 --> 25:20.810
You could tell?

25:20.894 --> 25:23.772
After watching the documentary
and seeing them in person,

25:23.855 --> 25:25.899
- it was very obvious.
- [chuckles]

25:25.982 --> 25:28.360
You're quick to notice.
No wonder you're our ace.

25:28.443 --> 25:29.527
[soft chuckle]

25:30.362 --> 25:32.447
By the way,
when did you first meet Mr. Choi?

25:32.530 --> 25:34.157
Uh, at the entrance ceremony.

25:34.741 --> 25:36.284
[Ji-ung] He was standing behind me.

25:36.368 --> 25:37.869
He shouldn't have been there, though.

25:38.495 --> 25:40.288
Honestly, he seemed quite charming to me.

25:40.372 --> 25:42.540
Was he popular
with the students at your school?

25:42.624 --> 25:44.251
I take it back. You're not our ace.

25:44.334 --> 25:45.794
You're a terrible judge of character.

25:46.378 --> 25:47.295
[chuckles]

25:49.506 --> 25:50.632
Yeon-su was the popular one.

25:50.715 --> 25:52.008
You mean Ms. Kook?

25:52.801 --> 25:54.219
I could tell that she was,

25:54.302 --> 25:56.263
although she looked cold
in the documentary.

25:56.346 --> 25:58.848
That's the reason why the boys
couldn't approach her then.

25:59.766 --> 26:00.892
I think she doesn't know,

26:00.976 --> 26:02.852
that a lot of guys used to
have a crush on her.

26:03.979 --> 26:05.981
[soft music]

26:06.606 --> 26:09.401
Did you two use to be close,
back in school?

26:09.484 --> 26:10.568
I'm not sure.

26:11.278 --> 26:13.822
I think I've always been just an observer.

26:15.865 --> 26:17.492
Oh, I think we're getting near now.

26:18.243 --> 26:19.744
You can just pull over there.

26:22.330 --> 26:24.457
[Ji-ung] You don't need
to come in early tomorrow.

26:25.292 --> 26:26.543
[Chae-ran] You know something?

26:26.626 --> 26:29.587
Our colleagues think that
you're a very cold and unfriendly person.

26:29.671 --> 26:31.756
I know I'm not popular with them.

26:31.840 --> 26:34.301
That's the reason why
nobody wants to work with me.

26:34.384 --> 26:35.927
You are popular, though.

26:36.011 --> 26:38.096
It's just that you always
seem unapproachable.

26:38.722 --> 26:39.889
You probably don't know this,

26:39.973 --> 26:42.434
but I honestly think that
many women have a crush on you.

26:43.768 --> 26:45.103
- [both chuckle]
- Shut up.

26:46.104 --> 26:47.856
Well, thank you. That's comforting.

26:48.523 --> 26:51.151
I wish more people knew
this side of you, the good one.

26:51.776 --> 26:53.361
Thank you for dropping me off.

26:53.445 --> 26:55.155
Sure. Get home safely.

26:55.238 --> 26:56.448
[shocked gasp]

26:57.907 --> 27:00.160
What the? Who is he?

27:00.243 --> 27:04.122
Oh, you didn't see him?
He was in the car with us all along.

27:04.205 --> 27:07.042
- Who is he?
- He's our reliable help sent by Mr. Park.

27:07.125 --> 27:09.044
- [Chae-ran] He's an intern.
- [sighs]

27:09.127 --> 27:11.338
It's nice to meet you.
I'm Im Tae-hun, sir.

27:11.921 --> 27:12.881
Intern?

27:12.964 --> 27:16.384
He started working yesterday
and hasn't gone home since then.

27:16.468 --> 27:17.719
Yeah, but I'm okay with that.

27:17.802 --> 27:19.596
But why would he send him to us?

27:19.679 --> 27:21.389
This isn't a daycare center.

27:21.473 --> 27:23.266
We're talking about
Mr. Park here, you know.

27:23.350 --> 27:25.352
Oh, damn it!

27:26.186 --> 27:28.355
Everything about this docu
is getting out of hand.

27:28.438 --> 27:29.689
Can't you just send him back?

27:29.773 --> 27:31.316
I'd rather work alone now.

27:33.109 --> 27:34.110
[sighs]

27:34.736 --> 27:35.612
- Get out.
- What?

27:35.695 --> 27:37.155
- Sure.
- Oh, okay.

27:43.912 --> 27:45.080
[pen thuds]

27:46.373 --> 27:48.041
[deep sigh]

27:51.753 --> 27:54.214
Well, you also ruined my life.
You wreaked havoc.

27:54.964 --> 27:57.675
Why did I have to say that
and sound so pathetic?

27:58.635 --> 28:00.261
[clicks tongue]
Damn it.

28:05.892 --> 28:06.976
[sighs]

28:07.477 --> 28:09.562
[soft music]

28:10.814 --> 28:12.649
I guess I won't sleep tonight.

28:13.400 --> 28:15.402
- [groaning]
- [thumping]

28:17.737 --> 28:18.655
[sighs]

28:18.738 --> 28:21.449
Do you think our breakup
was entirely my fault?

28:22.534 --> 28:25.620
[groans]
I really shouldn't have said that to him.

28:26.955 --> 28:30.750
Kook Yeon-su, are you insane?
You should have kept your cool.

28:32.377 --> 28:33.711
[sighs]

28:35.922 --> 28:37.215
[breathes sharply]

28:38.800 --> 28:39.801
[deep inhale]

28:43.138 --> 28:44.889
[deep steadying exhale]

28:45.473 --> 28:48.059
[soft music continues]

28:49.853 --> 28:51.146
[deep exhale]

28:54.441 --> 28:55.525
[frustrated sigh]

28:55.608 --> 28:58.903
Do I really have to do this
for an entire month?

28:58.987 --> 28:59.946
[sighs]

29:03.074 --> 29:04.075
[sighs]

29:09.956 --> 29:10.832
[soft sigh]

29:11.833 --> 29:13.918
HE'S LYING DOWN, HE'S SLEEPING

29:16.171 --> 29:17.630
[sighing]

29:17.714 --> 29:19.424
Just what do I do with those two?

29:20.842 --> 29:21.843
[deep sigh]

29:23.970 --> 29:24.888
SOEN

29:24.971 --> 29:28.767
In any case, I'm very delighted
that we could do this project together.

29:28.850 --> 29:29.684
It's our pleasure.

29:29.768 --> 29:32.479
We're truly honored
to work on this project with your group.

29:32.562 --> 29:34.272
It wasn't easy, to be honest,

29:34.355 --> 29:37.609
but Ms. Kook here,
has truly put her heart into it this one.

29:37.692 --> 29:39.819
Oh, I'm really flattered.

29:40.820 --> 29:43.656
I hope that this documentary
can also be of some advantage to us

29:43.740 --> 29:45.116
and can be used to promote our project.

29:45.700 --> 29:49.788
And I'd like to meet with the artist
in person, to get to know him better.

29:49.871 --> 29:51.998
[I-hun] Oh, excuse me,
can we all meet here instead--

29:52.081 --> 29:53.666
Oh, no need. I'll just go to you to do it.

29:53.750 --> 29:56.961
It must have been a hassle
to come all the way here all the time.

29:57.045 --> 29:59.464
So, it's better if I come to you.

30:00.215 --> 30:02.550
All right. We'll be very grateful
if you could do that for us.

30:02.634 --> 30:03.927
Okay. Shall we end this meeting?

30:04.010 --> 30:06.137
Oh, you can go ahead.

30:07.347 --> 30:10.558
By the way, we'll be holding
a small opening party this coming Friday.

30:10.642 --> 30:13.686
- And you can attend if you're free--
- [I-hun] Oh, a party? That'd be awesome.

30:13.770 --> 30:15.814
Yeah, party people. Yeah.

30:15.897 --> 30:17.106
[awkward chuckles]

30:18.191 --> 30:20.819
Will you be able
to attend this Friday's party?

30:20.902 --> 30:22.737
- Well, I have--
- Come on, you should go!

30:23.696 --> 30:27.575
Sure. I guess I'll be there,
if I have nothing scheduled.

30:27.659 --> 30:30.578
Well then, I'd like to speak
with Ms. Kook in private, so excuse us.

30:30.662 --> 30:32.038
Sure.

30:32.747 --> 30:35.083
[cheeky music]

30:35.792 --> 30:38.628
- [Ye-in] What'd you think?
- Looking at them now, I'm convinced.

30:38.711 --> 30:41.381
- What's this about?
- [Ye-in] I'm 900-percent sure of it.

30:41.464 --> 30:42.549
- Come with me.
- [chuckles]

30:42.632 --> 30:44.384
- Come on, hurry.
- But what about Ms. Kook?

30:45.051 --> 30:46.135
I have no idea, honestly.

30:47.887 --> 30:49.472
- [anchor] People love your work…
- What?

30:49.556 --> 30:51.724
- …especially your…
- He's even appearing on TV?

30:52.308 --> 30:54.561
[anchor] With that being said,
what do you think won their hearts?

30:54.644 --> 30:57.188
- [Nu-a] I'm not really sure.
- [Eun-ho] Did you pull an all-nighter?

30:57.272 --> 30:58.982
[Eun-ho] Wow, you're still filming him.

30:59.065 --> 31:00.358
Morning!

31:00.441 --> 31:03.027
Why'd you have to ruin my morning
by watching that crap?

31:03.111 --> 31:05.864
Oh, right. Nu-a is even
doing TV interviews lately.

31:06.489 --> 31:08.157
[sighs]
I really don't care.

31:09.075 --> 31:11.661
It's about time that
you revealed yourself to people

31:11.744 --> 31:14.163
and get rid of all the fake artists
out there, you know?

31:14.247 --> 31:15.832
So, should I schedule an interview?

31:15.915 --> 31:17.500
[sighs]
No, thanks.

31:17.584 --> 31:18.877
What's my schedule for this week?

31:19.711 --> 31:22.213
You have a meeting tomorrow
for that live drawing show.

31:22.297 --> 31:24.007
- [interview on TV continues]
- What?

31:25.008 --> 31:26.092
And then what else?

31:26.175 --> 31:28.636
- What's that asshole saying?
- [anchorwoman] … even saying plagiarism.

31:28.720 --> 31:31.014
Can you share with us,
what is your take on this?

31:31.639 --> 31:33.516
Ung. Get over here.

31:33.600 --> 31:35.268
This is a serious matter. Hurry up!

31:35.351 --> 31:37.186
- What is it this time?
- [Nu-a] I'm not sure.

31:37.270 --> 31:38.730
[Nu-a] Honestly, it's hard to say.

31:38.813 --> 31:41.357
This asshole's clearly
making fun of you right now.

31:42.191 --> 31:44.861
As you know, guys,
plagiarism isn't always black and white.

31:44.944 --> 31:46.738
- It's a vague thing. Right.
- [anchor] Right.

31:46.821 --> 31:49.741
I'm sure that the artist knows the best.

31:49.824 --> 31:54.162
[Nu-a] Or maybe I inspired him with
his work, since they're similar to mine.

31:54.245 --> 31:55.955
- [Nu-a] I don't mind that.
- [anchorwoman] I see.

31:57.624 --> 32:00.543
Has he gone insane?
He thinks you plagiarized his work.

32:00.627 --> 32:03.880
This won't do. Ung, don't worry, okay.
I'll contact all the reporters I know.

32:03.963 --> 32:05.548
Oh, forget it. Just ignore him.

32:06.132 --> 32:08.509
How can I ignore him
after what he just said on that TV show.

32:08.593 --> 32:10.803
Don't even think of responding.
It's tiring.

32:10.887 --> 32:13.306
Oh, no, you don't have to do anything.
I got it--

32:15.099 --> 32:18.102
I said, do nothing
if you wanna keep your job.

32:21.230 --> 32:22.190
[annoyed sigh]

32:24.108 --> 32:26.152
[suspenseful music]

32:30.281 --> 32:32.742
Ms. Kook, I think you should see this one.

32:40.083 --> 32:41.501
IS GO-OH GUILTY OF PLAGIARISM?

32:41.584 --> 32:44.837
[Myeong-ho] What do we do?
Should we inform Soen about this matter?

32:47.674 --> 32:50.176
I'll take care of Soen,
so don't do anything for now.

32:50.259 --> 32:52.804
And one more thing,
don't contact the artist.

32:52.887 --> 32:55.974
Would that be okay?
The public is quite upset about it.

32:56.057 --> 32:57.058
It's okay, really.

33:00.103 --> 33:02.981
Is there something you already know?
How are you so confident?

33:03.064 --> 33:06.275
It's not plagiarism.
So don't worry about it and keep working.

33:08.820 --> 33:10.822
[suspenseful music continues]

33:13.908 --> 33:16.119
[keyboard clacking]

33:25.003 --> 33:26.254
[sighs]

33:31.217 --> 33:34.095
Hey, what did he say? How is he?

33:34.178 --> 33:35.555
Well, he kicked me out, you know.

33:36.139 --> 33:38.099
He's so upset right now.

33:39.058 --> 33:41.352
He remained silent about it,
so I just gave up.

33:41.853 --> 33:44.814
Uh, damn it.
We really should counter that allegation.

33:44.897 --> 33:47.316
Leave him be.
He doesn't wanna get involved.

33:47.900 --> 33:49.360
This is what I think.

33:49.444 --> 33:51.988
He and Nu-a must have
known each other one way or another.

33:52.071 --> 33:54.574
But it's so frustrating
since he won't tell me anything.

33:55.324 --> 33:56.492
Wait, do you know anything?

33:57.827 --> 33:58.870
[inhales]

33:58.953 --> 34:01.372
I don't. But he seems familiar.

34:02.457 --> 34:04.500
[somber music]

34:11.299 --> 34:14.218
BEER IS LIFE
DAILYBEER

34:15.553 --> 34:18.139
We don't know anything
since he doesn't talk much.

34:18.222 --> 34:19.098
And there are times,

34:19.974 --> 34:22.185
when I just don't know
what's running through his mind.

34:22.268 --> 34:23.853
I really have no idea.

34:23.936 --> 34:27.148
His mom and I were very busy
ever since he was a little boy.

34:27.231 --> 34:30.485
Like he'd just sit on our bench
and play all by himself every day.

34:31.069 --> 34:32.361
He was always alone.

34:32.445 --> 34:34.238
I think maybe he got used to it.

34:35.364 --> 34:37.867
But then he was different
when he used to be with Yeon-su.

34:37.950 --> 34:39.577
He seemed energetic and full of life.

34:39.660 --> 34:41.037
And he also looked happy, you know.

34:41.120 --> 34:43.122
When I heard that you were filming
the documentary,

34:43.206 --> 34:44.832
and I would be seeing those cameras again,

34:44.916 --> 34:47.710
I literally jumped for joy, yes.

34:47.794 --> 34:51.297
If only he could be
just as lively as he was then,

34:51.380 --> 34:52.715
that would make me so happy.

34:53.299 --> 34:55.384
["Christmas Tree" by V playing]

34:59.180 --> 35:02.767
♪ In this moment ♪

35:02.850 --> 35:05.603
- ♪ I see you ♪
- [knocking]

35:05.686 --> 35:06.687
Yeah?

35:10.233 --> 35:11.067
Ung.

35:12.193 --> 35:14.362
The meeting with Soen is tomorrow.

35:14.946 --> 35:16.906
I can push it back if you want.

35:17.615 --> 35:18.658
What do you mean?

35:19.325 --> 35:21.494
What if they bring up
that stupid plagiarism issue?

35:21.577 --> 35:23.121
It's okay, I don't mind.

35:24.163 --> 35:25.915
Oh, did we receive any call?

35:25.998 --> 35:27.583
You mean from Soen?

35:27.667 --> 35:28.668
What I mean is…

35:29.418 --> 35:31.587
- Um, did anyone call us?
- No one did.

35:33.464 --> 35:35.842
I see. You can go.

35:36.884 --> 35:38.344
Okay, then.

35:39.053 --> 35:40.346
I'm going to sleep at home.

35:40.930 --> 35:42.849
I hope you'll be able to sleep well.

35:42.932 --> 35:44.517
- I'll get going.
- Mm-hmm.

35:46.060 --> 35:49.647
♪ You have never known ♪

35:49.730 --> 35:53.442
- ♪ It all gets tangled up inside ♪
- [sighs]

35:53.526 --> 35:55.611
♪ And I'll tell you ♪

35:57.780 --> 35:58.739
[Ung] What now?

35:59.490 --> 36:01.325
Isn't she interested in me anymore?

36:03.327 --> 36:08.166
- ♪ I just want to be where you are ♪
- [deep sigh]

36:09.125 --> 36:12.211
♪ It's such a strange thing to do ♪

36:12.295 --> 36:15.798
♪ Sometimes I don't understand you ♪

36:15.882 --> 36:19.218
RISING STAR GO-OH
ACCUSED OF PLAGIARISM

36:20.219 --> 36:22.972
♪ To where you are ♪

36:24.473 --> 36:26.142
[keyboard clacking]

36:28.978 --> 36:31.063
[soft music]

36:31.147 --> 36:35.151
NU-A DRAWS USING A DRAWING TABLET
WHILE GO-OH DRAWS BY HAND

36:36.444 --> 36:37.653
[sighs]

36:42.867 --> 36:43.910
[deep inhale]

36:48.998 --> 36:51.083
[soft music continues]

36:56.505 --> 36:58.132
[keyboard clacking]

37:00.051 --> 37:00.885
[sighs]

37:00.968 --> 37:04.096
Hey, how could you make your artist
wait for you, Eun-ho?

37:04.180 --> 37:06.349
[Eun-ho] I'm really sorry, Ung.
I'm almost there.

37:06.432 --> 37:09.310
Just go inside, say hello to everyone,
sit down and stay calm. Okay?

37:09.393 --> 37:10.311
You got me?

37:10.394 --> 37:11.270
Bye.

37:11.354 --> 37:12.647
[phone chimes]

37:14.357 --> 37:15.441
Well…

37:15.983 --> 37:17.068
I'm afraid

37:18.152 --> 37:19.737
I'll have to find a new manager.

37:24.492 --> 37:26.452
See, I'm never wrong with these things.

37:26.535 --> 37:28.579
- Hey, Myeong-ho.
- Yeah?

37:28.663 --> 37:31.457
- Did you see Mr. Jang a while ago?
- [sighs]

37:31.540 --> 37:34.335
He was looking for Ms. Kook
as soon as he arrived.

37:34.418 --> 37:35.628
He even had coffee.

37:35.711 --> 37:38.506
Yes, I saw him.
Now I'm also sure about it.

37:38.589 --> 37:39.715
[Ji-un] Sure about what?

37:40.883 --> 37:43.761
I'm pretty sure that Mr. Jang
has a crush on Ms. Kook.

37:43.844 --> 37:45.471
Right. You weren't
at the previous meeting.

37:45.554 --> 37:46.973
It was so obvious that day.

37:48.683 --> 37:50.851
That cold-hearted man
was so soft towards her,

37:50.935 --> 37:52.436
it's as if he was a different person.

37:52.520 --> 37:54.438
That's exactly what I've been telling you.

37:55.231 --> 37:58.567
Oh, the meeting's about to start.
Is everything all set?

37:58.651 --> 38:00.194
I already took care of it.

38:00.695 --> 38:01.821
- Goodness.
- Thanks a lot.

38:01.904 --> 38:04.282
Has Go-oh arrived already?
Because I really can't wait.

38:04.365 --> 38:05.533
Me too.

38:05.616 --> 38:08.828
- Stop being curious and join the meeting.
- Sure.

38:08.911 --> 38:11.539
- Okay then. I'll just be waiting inside.
- Okay.

38:11.622 --> 38:12.707
- Let's go.
- See you.

38:12.790 --> 38:14.292
Oh, goodness gracious!

38:15.459 --> 38:16.794
Did I spill my coffee?

38:17.545 --> 38:19.380
Oh, that would have been a disaster.

38:19.463 --> 38:20.673
Oh, my. How can I help…

38:22.591 --> 38:24.260
What? Oh!

38:24.969 --> 38:26.178
You're Choi Ung!

38:31.309 --> 38:32.226
[steadying breath]

38:35.187 --> 38:36.022
[gasps]

38:44.322 --> 38:46.574
Oh, uh, the meeting's this way.

38:46.657 --> 38:47.658
Please.

38:55.041 --> 38:57.168
- I like the beginning part.
- [Yeon-su] Okay.

38:57.251 --> 39:00.004
- We should begin from here, this part.
- [Yeon-su] Okay.

39:02.298 --> 39:03.424
Excuse me.

39:04.342 --> 39:06.802
I'm pretty sure that Mr. Jang
has a crush on Ms. Kook.

39:14.518 --> 39:17.396
What do you think?
Should we begin once your manager arrives?

39:17.480 --> 39:20.399
Oh, well, we can start
this meeting now, it's okay.

39:20.483 --> 39:22.360
I think it'd be best if he were here.

39:23.110 --> 39:26.530
Then would you mind if I ask you
a question before we begin?

39:27.448 --> 39:28.532
Sure.

39:29.575 --> 39:31.744
I'd like to ask about
the issue concerning you right now.

39:33.829 --> 39:34.663
Is it plagiarism?

39:35.414 --> 39:38.167
- But, Mr. Jang--
- I tend to be straightforward, you know.

39:38.667 --> 39:42.088
I'm sorry if I offended you,
but this matter is very important to us.

39:44.507 --> 39:46.550
[tense music]

39:49.678 --> 39:51.013
Must I answer that?

39:51.097 --> 39:52.932
That'd be best for our sake.

39:59.188 --> 40:01.232
[tense music continues]

40:04.485 --> 40:07.738
There's nothing to worry about.
That wasn't plagiarism.

40:08.781 --> 40:11.784
Well, from what I know,
plagiarism isn't always black and white.

40:11.867 --> 40:14.245
And I heard it's hard to prove
that you didn't plagiarize anything.

40:14.745 --> 40:16.330
So how will you go about
that allegation concerning you?

40:16.414 --> 40:18.707
Are you really sure
that this won't be an issue?

40:18.791 --> 40:21.043
Excuse me, but I don't think
that's something you should--

40:21.127 --> 40:22.336
[Ung] It's pretty simple, really.

40:23.003 --> 40:25.214
There are many reasons
to back my argument,

40:25.297 --> 40:28.134
but they won't find proof
that I plagiarized anything.

40:28.217 --> 40:29.677
That's why I'm confident.

40:34.557 --> 40:35.850
Thank you for telling us that.

40:35.933 --> 40:38.310
I had no choice
but to confirm this with you.

40:38.394 --> 40:41.063
I knew it could sound offensive,
but I had to ask you anyway.

40:41.147 --> 40:44.442
But since you're sure of it,
we can proceed with this project.

40:44.525 --> 40:45.860
Sure. That's all right.

40:45.943 --> 40:47.903
And by the way,
if you're free this Friday,

40:47.987 --> 40:50.906
would you like to come and attend
Soen's opening party?

40:50.990 --> 40:52.950
We would be happy if you could make it.

40:53.033 --> 40:55.411
[Do-yul] I'd also like to make up
for what I did today.

40:55.494 --> 40:56.912
Can you let me think about it?

40:56.996 --> 40:58.873
Ms. Kook will also be attending the event.

41:01.584 --> 41:02.877
Am I right, Ms. Kook?

41:04.545 --> 41:06.422
Uh. Well, I'm…

41:11.260 --> 41:12.636
Okay, I'm going.

41:15.890 --> 41:17.099
Thank you for inviting me.

41:18.142 --> 41:19.477
[door opening]

41:19.560 --> 41:21.770
Hello. everyone.
I'm so sorry for being late.

41:21.854 --> 41:23.314
- Have a seat, please.
- Okay.

41:25.441 --> 41:28.611
All right, then.
Let's skip the beginning part.

41:28.694 --> 41:31.030
You better not be late
for another meeting.

41:31.113 --> 41:33.657
I'm really, really sorry.
Oh, should we call a cab?

41:34.283 --> 41:35.284
Hold on.

41:38.329 --> 41:40.414
Have you ever been to a party?

41:41.165 --> 41:44.084
A party? What kind? A birthday party?

41:44.710 --> 41:46.879
Not that. It's more of a classy one.

41:46.962 --> 41:48.589
Oh, a classy one.

41:49.381 --> 41:50.758
- So have you?
- I haven't.

41:50.841 --> 41:53.385
I only see them on TV.
I've never been to one. Why?

41:54.720 --> 41:56.764
I'm just wondering
what the dress code might be.

41:58.307 --> 42:00.184
A tuxedo and then a bow tie?

42:03.312 --> 42:05.481
Forget it. I shouldn't have asked you.

42:05.564 --> 42:06.857
Hey, what's this about?

42:07.733 --> 42:10.903
Never mind. Go home first.
I need to stop by somewhere.

42:10.986 --> 42:12.988
Hey, Ji-ung,
let's just end the shoot here.

42:13.072 --> 42:14.323
This is personal.

42:14.406 --> 42:15.658
But it's my job to film your private life.

42:15.741 --> 42:17.451
I'm sure you got enough today.

42:17.535 --> 42:21.413
And if you never give me any privacy,
I'm just going to drop out of this.

42:21.497 --> 42:23.499
Okay. I'll let it slide for today.

42:23.582 --> 42:26.919
But let me tell you,
that threat is getting old real fast.

42:27.002 --> 42:27.836
[clicks tongue]

42:28.754 --> 42:30.047
[Ung sighs]

42:30.130 --> 42:31.090
Where is he going?

42:32.466 --> 42:34.093
Oh, I think you'd look great in that.

42:34.969 --> 42:36.720
[shoppers chatting]

42:38.430 --> 42:39.598
[sighs deeply]

42:40.724 --> 42:42.768
[bright music]

42:45.479 --> 42:46.647
[deep exhale]

42:54.905 --> 42:56.824
KOOK YEON-SU

42:58.993 --> 43:01.287
[bright music continues]

43:13.090 --> 43:14.091
Oh.

43:16.927 --> 43:18.554
- This way, please.
- Come this way.

43:28.731 --> 43:29.690
[clears throat]

43:31.567 --> 43:32.860
Hello there, Mr. Choi.

43:33.694 --> 43:35.404
Wow. Hi.

43:36.071 --> 43:38.198
I never thought
I'd visit a place like this.

43:39.158 --> 43:42.411
Well, I'm obviously
underdressed for this place, right?

43:43.245 --> 43:45.956
Don't worry, though.
I'll take care of you.

43:46.040 --> 43:49.001
I never expected you
to wanna shop with me, to be honest.

43:49.084 --> 43:50.419
You're always unpredictable.

43:50.502 --> 43:53.130
I'm so sorry.
You must have been very flustered.

43:53.213 --> 43:55.382
I was only flustered
that I couldn't say no

43:55.466 --> 43:56.925
since I had an empty schedule anyway.

43:57.009 --> 43:58.260
That's a relief.

43:58.344 --> 44:00.512
Anyway, thank you so much for your help.

44:00.596 --> 44:03.599
I promise to repay you
with much kindness later on.

44:03.682 --> 44:06.477
Honestly, I've never
bought a suit in my life,

44:06.560 --> 44:07.936
so I didn't know what to buy.

44:08.771 --> 44:10.648
And you were the only one
I could think of.

44:10.731 --> 44:13.817
Oh. I like so much what you just said.

44:15.986 --> 44:18.947
I hope it'll stay that way,
even in the future, Mr. Choi.

44:20.908 --> 44:23.619
All right.
Shall we have some fun today then?

44:24.119 --> 44:25.287
Uh…

44:25.371 --> 44:29.917
♪ Someday we'll miss the days we had ♪

44:31.377 --> 44:32.961
♪ Days we had ♪

44:33.045 --> 44:35.172
♪ Someday we'll be ♪

44:35.255 --> 44:36.256
That one.

44:36.757 --> 44:38.634
["Why" by Janet Suhh playing]

44:42.638 --> 44:43.472
NJ.

44:51.397 --> 44:52.606
[chuckles]

44:54.274 --> 44:59.238
♪ Again and again and again ♪

44:59.321 --> 45:00.656
[NJ] It's comfortable.

45:02.866 --> 45:04.159
How are these?

45:04.243 --> 45:05.494
What about these?

45:06.203 --> 45:08.122
["Why" by Janet Suhh playing]

45:22.594 --> 45:24.012
[clapping]

45:24.930 --> 45:26.014
I like it.

45:30.686 --> 45:33.313
Oh, NJ, you left your shopping bags there.

45:33.897 --> 45:36.525
Oh, it's okay.
They'll send them over to my place.

45:36.608 --> 45:39.445
Wow, we really live
in two different worlds.

45:40.612 --> 45:43.198
We went shopping for four hours today.

45:43.282 --> 45:45.033
That's pretty short, right?

45:45.117 --> 45:47.870
- And I only shopped for 30 minutes though.
- Aren't you hungry now?

45:47.953 --> 45:50.664
Oh, let me treat you,
as a way of thanking you.

45:50.747 --> 45:52.749
Sure, I'm craving for something.

45:55.002 --> 45:57.045
[light music]

45:59.465 --> 46:02.926
You know, I may not be
as wealthy as you are.

46:03.010 --> 46:04.344
But I'm still well off.

46:04.887 --> 46:07.181
And I could have bought you
fancier food, at least.

46:08.724 --> 46:11.435
Shopping and tteokbokki
go hand in hand, that's why.

46:11.518 --> 46:14.897
I'd feel guilty about spending money
every time I shopped in the past.

46:14.980 --> 46:17.483
So I'd starve myself
or have tteokbokki or fish cakes.

46:17.566 --> 46:19.067
It's a guilty pleasure.

46:19.151 --> 46:21.695
Oh. I'm actually surprised
you're like that.

46:22.529 --> 46:24.823
Well, I may seem like a born-to-be star,

46:24.907 --> 46:27.159
but I was a normal kid like the others.

46:29.495 --> 46:30.579
[hums in delight]

46:32.080 --> 46:33.373
[hums in delight]

46:33.457 --> 46:34.625
[NJ chuckles]

46:35.501 --> 46:36.793
So why did you want to shop?

46:36.877 --> 46:38.629
Are you appearing on TV?

46:39.213 --> 46:41.632
Are you taking revenge on that guy Nu-a?

46:41.715 --> 46:43.342
Did you watch that one?

46:43.425 --> 46:45.719
There were news articles on it,
so of course I did.

46:45.802 --> 46:46.762
I always read the news.

46:47.846 --> 46:48.680
Mm…

46:49.264 --> 46:50.516
[Ung] That's not the reason why.

46:51.350 --> 46:52.935
I'm attending an opening party.

46:53.018 --> 46:54.770
Hmm, a party?

46:55.938 --> 46:58.357
Well then, wear the first shirt
that has no tie.

46:58.440 --> 47:00.317
Match that with the second pair of shoes.

47:00.400 --> 47:03.862
Oh, wow, you're really
a pro at these things.

47:03.946 --> 47:04.905
[chuckles]

47:05.489 --> 47:06.740
That's the price of fame, you know?

47:08.075 --> 47:09.117
What?

47:09.618 --> 47:12.079
Fame isn't always
about the prestige of getting known.

47:12.663 --> 47:14.373
[NJ] What I mean is,
now that you're famous,

47:14.456 --> 47:16.750
people are making
ridiculous rumors about you.

47:17.417 --> 47:20.128
[soft music]

47:20.212 --> 47:21.171
[scoffs]

47:21.255 --> 47:22.130
Thank you then.

47:23.924 --> 47:26.677
That means you believe
that I didn't plagiarize.

47:26.760 --> 47:29.930
I'm on your side, of course.
I have an eye for art.

47:33.976 --> 47:35.269
Please enjoy.

47:35.352 --> 47:36.395
Thank you so much.

47:36.478 --> 47:38.981
- Hang on, can we have two soju glasses?
- [vendor] Okay.

47:39.064 --> 47:40.274
Are we drinking now?

47:40.357 --> 47:43.902
'Cause I think ending this night
with soju would be perfect.

47:43.986 --> 47:45.487
But I have a shoot tomorrow.

47:45.571 --> 47:48.448
Although I'd crave it too much
if you drank some only by yourself,

47:48.949 --> 47:51.702
so let's just pretend this water is soju.

47:55.581 --> 47:57.666
[soft music continues]

48:03.171 --> 48:05.882
[Yeon-su] I know…
you didn't plagiarize anything,

48:05.966 --> 48:07.092
so don't worry about it.

48:09.720 --> 48:12.264
[gentle music]

48:17.185 --> 48:20.772
Don't take to heart
what Mr. Jang said today.

48:28.238 --> 48:30.365
[deep breath]

48:33.076 --> 48:35.912
I BELIEVE YOU

48:39.708 --> 48:40.584
[phone thuds]

48:48.216 --> 48:50.010
[music fades]

48:51.887 --> 48:56.808
- [indistinct TV dialogue]
- [Eun-ho chuckles]

48:56.892 --> 48:59.061
[Ung] Hey, have you seen my car keys?

48:59.144 --> 49:00.395
Wait, what did you say?

49:01.313 --> 49:03.940
- [Ung] Have you seen my car keys?
- Car keys?

49:04.024 --> 49:05.609
Why would you look for them?

49:05.692 --> 49:07.778
You put them away somewhere
since you never drive.

49:07.861 --> 49:08.987
[chuckles]

49:13.158 --> 49:14.242
[Ung] You really don't know?

49:14.326 --> 49:15.535
Who are you?

49:15.619 --> 49:17.371
[Ung] I know I look awkward.

49:17.454 --> 49:18.830
Are you going on a blind date tonight?

49:18.914 --> 49:20.165
[Ung grumbles]
Shut up.

49:21.166 --> 49:23.585
That hurt my pride,
but my heart fluttered a bit.

49:23.669 --> 49:24.836
Hey, you come back here.

49:24.920 --> 49:27.964
- [Ung] I said, shut up, okay?
- Tell me where you're going first.

49:28.048 --> 49:29.508
Why aren't you taking me with you?

49:30.550 --> 49:32.636
[light music]

49:54.991 --> 49:57.369
[guests chatting]

50:03.041 --> 50:05.085
- [glass clinking]
- [indistinct chatter]

50:14.511 --> 50:16.805
[sighs]
I shouldn't have come.

50:16.888 --> 50:18.306
This was a bad idea.

50:22.227 --> 50:23.562
[groans]
I'm sorry.

50:25.731 --> 50:28.608
[sweet music]

50:40.370 --> 50:41.663
Where are you going?

50:43.665 --> 50:45.459
Why are you leaving me here alone?

50:45.542 --> 50:48.253
Uh, I was just…

50:48.336 --> 50:49.880
[Do-yul] Hi, Ms. Kook.

50:50.964 --> 50:51.882
You're here now.

50:52.758 --> 50:54.176
Oh, I see you're here too.

50:54.259 --> 50:55.552
Thanks for coming.

50:55.635 --> 50:57.012
I just had to keep my word.

50:57.095 --> 50:59.055
Then I hope you both enjoy the party.

50:59.139 --> 51:00.515
There's someone
I'd like you to meet right now.

51:00.599 --> 51:02.058
- Okay.
- [Do-yul] This way.

51:03.518 --> 51:05.562
[guests chatting]

51:06.897 --> 51:08.398
They're from France.

51:09.524 --> 51:11.526
[Do-yul] Gentlemen,
I'd like you to meet Ms. Kook.

51:12.027 --> 51:13.445
[deep exhale]

51:18.867 --> 51:19.910
[Ung sighs]

51:20.410 --> 51:23.580
I don't have a single idea
why I came to this party.

51:23.663 --> 51:24.915
[sighs]

51:25.415 --> 51:26.416
Hey.

51:27.000 --> 51:29.211
You've gone too far
by coming all the way here, you know.

51:29.294 --> 51:32.214
Didn't you wanna show that you're not
the same loser you were 10 years ago?

51:32.297 --> 51:33.131
Today is your chance.

51:34.049 --> 51:35.717
Well, it's not bad, right?

51:35.801 --> 51:36.802
Whatever.

51:38.220 --> 51:40.222
- Let's film Yeon-su now.
- [cameraman] Okay.

51:40.305 --> 51:42.349
Hey, hold on. Don't bother.

51:42.432 --> 51:45.519
She's surrounded by people right now
and pretending to be pre-occupied.

51:46.228 --> 51:47.979
- [groans]
- Be right back.

51:53.527 --> 51:55.403
[indistinct chatter]

51:57.697 --> 51:58.532
[man] Hey.

51:59.199 --> 52:00.742
It's been a long time.

52:01.618 --> 52:04.246
I wasn't sure, but you came.
How long has it been?

52:05.622 --> 52:06.748
[deep exhale]

52:07.707 --> 52:09.292
Where are you going? I'm talking to you.

52:10.377 --> 52:11.670
[sighs]
Drop it.

52:12.420 --> 52:14.256
You're not someone worth my time.

52:15.048 --> 52:17.050
What the…? Why are you so edgy?

52:17.133 --> 52:19.052
I'm just not interested in talking.

52:19.135 --> 52:19.970
Step aside.

52:20.053 --> 52:22.514
Are you still bitter toward me?
You have to be honest.

52:22.597 --> 52:24.015
[sharp breath]
Not sure.

52:25.016 --> 52:26.476
I pitied you a bit back then.

52:27.394 --> 52:28.687
But now I'm just indifferent.

52:33.650 --> 52:35.735
Why haven't you countered the allegation?

52:35.819 --> 52:37.070
You can't be bothered by it?

52:38.238 --> 52:39.364
You're smart after all.

52:39.865 --> 52:42.409
Then you must know
that I'm wasting my time right now.

52:46.121 --> 52:47.706
Let's just do well, okay?

52:50.250 --> 52:51.167
What's that?

52:52.878 --> 52:53.962
Sorry?

52:54.671 --> 52:57.048
[stutters]
Haven't you heard? Did you think…

52:58.258 --> 53:00.260
that you were the only one doing it?

53:02.095 --> 53:03.013
What?

53:03.096 --> 53:04.806
[chuckles]

53:05.473 --> 53:07.017
I'm also doing the live show.

53:08.018 --> 53:09.019
[Nu-a] But now I guess…

53:10.312 --> 53:12.147
you weren't that reliable.

53:15.525 --> 53:17.611
[pensive music]

53:24.951 --> 53:27.746
[Ung] What the hell is going on here?

53:27.829 --> 53:30.415
- [man 1] It's for the best, right?
- [man 2] Of course, it is.

53:30.498 --> 53:33.668
[man 2] Two controversial artists
will be competing against each other.

53:33.752 --> 53:36.087
[man 1] I bet this will definitely
be a spectacle.

53:36.171 --> 53:37.130
[man 2] You think so?

53:37.631 --> 53:39.758
- [man 1] Of course.
- [indistinct chatter]

53:40.300 --> 53:41.676
[indistinct chatter]

53:41.760 --> 53:45.096
I mean, he grabbed the opportunity
when it came. I'm excited for this.

53:45.180 --> 53:47.724
- [man 1] Yeah, me too.
- [man 2] Of course, who wouldn't be right?

53:48.391 --> 53:50.018
[emotionally charged music]

53:52.062 --> 53:53.480
- Kook Yeon-su.
- Huh?

53:55.649 --> 53:56.691
Hmm?

53:57.901 --> 53:59.152
Do you know about this?

54:00.862 --> 54:01.863
About what?

54:03.448 --> 54:04.449
[Yeon-su] What is it?

54:05.825 --> 54:09.371
Why is he giving me that look right now?
What is it this time?

54:09.454 --> 54:10.455
Did you…

54:12.040 --> 54:13.708
also know about it?

54:14.960 --> 54:16.836
Excuse me, what's this about?

54:17.963 --> 54:19.214
[Ung] Did you know that…

54:20.465 --> 54:22.676
that Nu-a's also
taking part in this project?

54:24.177 --> 54:25.220
I'm asking you, Ms. Kook.

54:28.807 --> 54:30.850
Wait, what do you…

54:30.934 --> 54:32.811
[music building]

54:34.688 --> 54:35.855
[Do-yul] Excuse me.

54:36.523 --> 54:38.817
Can we just talk about that matter later?

54:38.900 --> 54:40.568
[music stops]

54:40.652 --> 54:41.778
You see?

54:42.988 --> 54:44.406
It's always been you…

54:46.574 --> 54:47.826
You ruin me.

54:48.952 --> 54:50.954
["Maybe If" by BIBI playing]

54:51.955 --> 54:53.957
♪ Maybe If I ♪

54:55.458 --> 54:58.795
♪ Woke up in the morning ♪

54:59.546 --> 55:02.632
♪ Hearing your voice ♪

55:02.716 --> 55:06.511
♪ Maybe if I was with you ♪

55:07.262 --> 55:09.889
[singing in Korean]

55:15.311 --> 55:18.440
[Yeon-su] Well, I was acting normally.
As usual.

55:18.523 --> 55:20.984
[Ung] It wasn't like her to do that.
But that day…

55:21.067 --> 55:22.819
[Yeon-su] That time
he was the one who kept--

55:22.902 --> 55:25.071
[Ung] I can tell that
she was setting the mood that time.

55:25.572 --> 55:27.032
I can tell she's very…

55:27.115 --> 55:28.324
Hey.

55:29.868 --> 55:32.579
What… what will you say
in our final interview?

55:32.662 --> 55:34.080
Hmm?

55:34.164 --> 55:37.042
I mean, during the previous interview,

55:37.125 --> 55:40.253
you said you were wasting your time
because you had to film with me.

55:40.336 --> 55:43.006
Did you overhear that?
You shouldn't eavesdrop.

55:43.089 --> 55:44.466
[rain pattering]

55:46.593 --> 55:47.927
But how about this time?

55:49.012 --> 55:51.097
Do you think you're still wasting time?

55:52.348 --> 55:55.143
[Yeon-su] He looked very serious,
which was so unlike him.

55:55.226 --> 55:57.562
Hmm? How about now?

55:58.229 --> 55:59.981
[Yeon-su] He also asked
a strange question.

56:03.234 --> 56:04.110
Well…

56:05.195 --> 56:09.324
I guess I don't completely
feel that way anymore.

56:12.327 --> 56:14.245
And since today is our final shooting,

56:14.996 --> 56:16.664
I'll tell them that I'm okay with it now.

56:19.834 --> 56:22.420
[Ung] To my surprise,
she even smiled at me.

56:25.006 --> 56:26.841
And you? How was it for you?

56:30.386 --> 56:32.806
What? What are you gonna say?

56:34.349 --> 56:37.310
"She's annoying,
bothersome, and irritating."

56:37.393 --> 56:38.978
[Ung] "I wish she never came to school."

56:39.062 --> 56:40.688
"I'd hit her with a camera if I could--"

56:40.772 --> 56:42.857
That's enough. I get it, so stop it.

56:44.275 --> 56:46.444
[sighs]
Why did I even ask you?

56:46.528 --> 56:48.738
- And…
- Yeah, I get it that you don't like me.

56:48.822 --> 56:49.656
Shut up, I--

56:49.739 --> 56:53.284
That's… not true, you know?

56:54.953 --> 56:58.206
[Ung] That's the reason why
I blurted out something so stupid.

56:59.791 --> 57:00.834
I don't dislike you.

57:03.878 --> 57:05.880
[soft sweet music]

57:08.883 --> 57:11.761
Thank you for not disliking me.

57:16.558 --> 57:18.434
[Yeon-su] He kept staring at me
at that moment.

57:19.018 --> 57:20.228
It was really strange.

57:25.358 --> 57:26.484
Uh, and you?

57:37.579 --> 57:38.496
[Yeon-su] Hey.

57:39.080 --> 57:40.582
Your face is really red.

57:43.084 --> 57:44.836
Wait, you're running a fever.

57:44.919 --> 57:46.212
Oh.

57:46.296 --> 57:48.423
What do you mean, "Oh"? Are you okay?

57:48.506 --> 57:49.883
You're burning up.

57:50.925 --> 57:52.886
Uh, I'm okay, though.

57:52.969 --> 57:54.679
You're definitely not okay.

57:54.762 --> 57:55.763
Here.

57:56.431 --> 57:57.932
I'm really okay. So take it.

57:58.016 --> 58:00.226
I just don't want you
to blame me, okay. So here.

58:00.310 --> 58:01.811
So much for trying to look cool.

58:01.895 --> 58:03.605
I said I'm really fine, just wear it.

58:03.688 --> 58:06.941
How can you get a fever when you were
only in the rain for a short time?

58:07.025 --> 58:10.278
I told you, as a senior, taking care of
your health is also an important virtue.

58:10.361 --> 58:13.031
Yeah, yeah. There you go again.

58:13.114 --> 58:14.824
Are you seriously nagging me right now?

58:14.908 --> 58:16.367
Shut up and put this on.

58:17.952 --> 58:20.622
I take back
what I said about not disliking you.

58:27.086 --> 58:30.632
[Yeon-su] He was the one
who set the mood first during that moment

58:30.715 --> 58:32.217
that rainy day.

58:32.300 --> 58:33.593
Does that mean…

58:34.177 --> 58:36.012
that you really dislike me?

58:38.598 --> 58:41.226
Or was it because of the weather?

58:41.309 --> 58:42.143
No.

58:43.478 --> 58:46.314
[Ung] Or was it because
I was running a fever that day?

58:46.397 --> 58:47.398
So?

58:47.482 --> 58:50.818
[Yeon-su] Or was I
running a fever just like him?

58:50.902 --> 58:51.945
[Ung] I'm pretty sure

58:52.445 --> 58:53.905
that it was because of the weather.

58:54.447 --> 58:55.615
It was unpredictable.

58:56.574 --> 58:57.825
This is good.

58:57.909 --> 58:59.911
["Christmas Tree" by V playing]

59:04.749 --> 59:06.334
I think I like you.

59:09.295 --> 59:14.008
♪ It always comes around as I believed ♪

59:16.052 --> 59:19.347
♪ When the rain stops ♪

59:19.847 --> 59:22.141
♪ You shine on me ♪

59:22.934 --> 59:28.606
♪ Your light's the only thing
That keeps the cold out ♪

59:29.274 --> 59:32.485
♪ Moon in the summer night ♪

59:32.569 --> 59:35.113
[Chae-ran] Did you two
used to be close back in school?

59:36.656 --> 59:38.074
[Ji-ung] I'm not sure.

59:38.157 --> 59:41.160
I think I've always been just an observer.

59:44.414 --> 59:48.960
THE BOY, OR THE GIRL, WE LIKED THEN

59:49.043 --> 59:52.922
♪ You have never known ♪

59:53.006 --> 59:56.634
♪ It all gets tangled up inside ♪

59:56.718 --> 59:59.304
♪ And I'll tell you ♪

59:59.387 --> 01:00:02.849
♪ A million little reasons ♪

01:00:02.932 --> 01:00:06.644
♪ I'm falling for your eyes ♪

01:00:06.728 --> 01:00:11.065
♪ I just want to be where you are ♪

01:00:12.233 --> 01:00:14.902
- [phone buzzing]
- [Ji-ung] Ung has always been like this.

01:00:14.986 --> 01:00:18.364
His whole world would shatter
whenever Yeon-su would appear.

01:00:18.448 --> 01:00:21.701
How hard is it for you to say sorry?
I'm the one who gives in in the end.

01:00:23.411 --> 01:00:25.663
I'll do it. I'll work with Nu-a.

01:00:26.956 --> 01:00:28.249
[Eun-ho] Something more artistic…

01:00:28.333 --> 01:00:29.334
[Eun-ho] Did it just throw up?

01:00:29.417 --> 01:00:31.502
- Oh, did the camera throw up?
- Do you wanna die?

01:00:32.086 --> 01:00:33.630
[Yeon-su] I'm sorry.

01:00:33.713 --> 01:00:35.423
[Ung] Let's not allow our emotions
to get in the way.

01:00:35.506 --> 01:00:38.718
♪ I just want to be where you are ♪
